{
  "name": "search_products",
  "description": "Search the DemoStore catalogue. Use this whenever the customer asks what is available, names a device, or asks about price. Each result includes variants with their own id, price_cents and stock — in this catalogue the variant is what carries the colour, the storage and the memory, and each variant has its own price. You must pass a VARIANT id (not the product id) to add_cart_item. Prefer limit=3 so the reply stays readable in chat.",
